":6,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use Frontend Editor Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true},{\"id\":\"8807\",\"item_id\":\"8807\",\"order\":7,\"item_order\":7,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use Gradebook Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true},{\"id\":\"8809\",\"item_id\":\"8809\",\"order\":8,\"item_order\":8,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use Paid Memberships Pro Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true},{\"id\":\"8808\",\"item_id\":\"8808\",\"order\":9,\"item_order\":9,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use Stripe Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true},{\"id\":\"8806\",\"item_id\":\"8806\",\"order\":10,\"item_order\":10,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use WooCommerce Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true},{\"id\":\"13604\",\"item_id\":\"13604\",\"order\":11,\"item_order\":11,\"type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"item_type\":\"lp_lesson\",\"title\":\"How to use WPML Add-on for LearnPress?\",\"preview\":true}]}]}', 0, 0, 1, '2024-10-29 01:42:06', '<h4>COURSE DESCRIPTION</h4>\nLearnPress is a comprehensive <em>WordPress LMS Plugin</em> for WordPress. This is one of the best WordPress LMS Plugins which can be used to easily create &amp; sell courses online. You can create a course curriculum with lessons &amp; quizzes included which is managed with an easy-to-use interface for users. Having this WordPress LMS Plugin, now you have a chance to quickly and easily create education, online school, online-course websites with no coding knowledge required.\n\nLearnPress is free and always will be, but it is still a premium high-quality WordPress Plugin that definitely helps you with making money from your <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WordPress Based LMS</strong></a>. Just try and see how amazing it is. LearnPress WordPress Online Course plugin is lightweight and super powerful with lots of <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Add-Ons</strong></a> to empower its core system.', 'Introduction LearnPress - LMS plugin', 'publish', 'introduction-learnpress-lms-plugin', 0, NULL),
