2015\\/11\\/team-1.jpg\",\"id\":2918,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"client_title\":\"Code quality\",\"client_content\":\"<p>\\u201c LearnPress is a WordPress complete solution for creating a Learning Management System (LMS). It can help me to create courses, lessons and quizzes and manage them as easy as I want. I\'ve learned a lot, and I highly recommend it. Thank you. \\u201d<\\/p>\"},{\"_id\":\"ff6181f\",\"client_name\":\"Elsie\",\"client_position\":\"Copyrighter\",\"client_avatar\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/luatsu.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/team-7.jpg\",\"id\":2923,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"client_title\":\"Great quality!\",\"client_content\":\"<p>\\u201c You don\'t need a whole ecommerce system to sell your online courses. Paypal, Stripe payment methods integration can help you sell your courses out of the box. In the case you wanna use WooCommerce, this awesome WordPress LMS Plugin will serve you well too. \\u201d<\\/p>\"},{\"client_name\":\"Anthony\",\"client_position\":\"CEO\",\"client_avatar\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/luatsu.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/team-1.jpg\",\"id\":2918,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"client_title\":\"Great quality!\",\"client_content\":\"<p>\\u201c Education WP Theme is a comprehensive LMS solution for WordPress Theme. This beautiful theme based on LearnPress - the best WordPress LMS plugin. Education WP theme will bring you the best LMS experience ever with super friendly UX and complete eLearning features. \\u201d<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"008b2dc\"},{\"client_name\":\"Susan Jackson\",\"client_position\":\"Wordpress Developer\",\"client_avatar\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/luatsu.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/team-6.jpg\",\"id\":2920,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"client_title\":\"Great quality!\",\"client_content\":\"<p>\\u201c Education WP is a special build for an effective education &amp; Learning Management System site. Education WP is the next generation &amp; one of the best education WordPress themes which contains all the strength of eLearning WP and comes with better UI\\/UX. \\u201d<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"0789fae\"},{\"client_name\":\"Peter Packer\",\"_id\":\"2a0ea61\",\"client_position\":\"Front-end Developer\",\"client_avatar\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/luatsu.local\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2015\\/11\\/team-5.jpg\",\"id\":2921,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"client_title\":\"Code quality\",\"client_content\":\"Morbi accumsan ipsum velit. Nam nec tellus a odio tincidunt auctor a ornare odio. Sed non mauris itae erat\"}],\"angular\":\"yes\",\"angular_background\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"avatar_layout\":\"avatar_left_client_name\",\"client_avatar_size_size\":\"full\",\"client_avatar_size_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"90\",\"height\":\"90\"},\"client_avatar_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"50\",\"right\":\"50\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"50\",\"isLinked\":true},\"client_avatar_item_background_background\":\"classic\",\"section_wathermark_hover_color\":\"#FAD556\",\"slidesPerGroup\":1,\"angular_position_offset_x\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"angular_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27,\"sizes\":[]},\"angular_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27,\"sizes\":[]},\"client_title_color\":\"#000000\",\"client_title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"layout_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":800,\"sizes\":[]},\"client_client_avatar_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"3\",\"right\":\"3\",\"bottom\":\"3\",\"left\":\"3\",\"isLinked\":true},\"client_title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"client_title_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"client_title_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"client_content_typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"client_content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"slider_show_pagination\":\"bullets\",\"slider_pagination_vertical_offset\":20,\"slider_dot_spacin