(5428, 1, '2024-10-29 01:42:06', '2024-10-29 01:42:06', '<h4>COURSE DESCRIPTION</h4>\nLearnPress is a comprehensive <em>WordPress LMS Plugin</em> for WordPress. This is one of the best WordPress LMS Plugins which can be used to easily create &amp; sell courses online. You can create a course curriculum with lessons &amp; quizzes included which is managed with an easy-to-use interface for users. Having this WordPress LMS Plugin, now you have a chance to quickly and easily create education, online school, online-course websites with no coding knowledge required.\n\nLearnPress is free and always will be, but it is still a premium high-quality WordPress Plugin that definitely helps you with making money from your <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>WordPress Based LMS</strong></a>. Just try and see how amazing it is. LearnPress WordPress Online Course plugin is lightweight and super powerful with lots of <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Add-Ons</strong></a> to empower its core system.', 'Introduction LearnPress - LMS plugin', 'A WordPress LMS Plugin to create WordPress Learning Management System. Turn your WP to LMS WordPress with Courses, Lessons, Quizzes & more. ', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'introduction-learnpress-lms-plugin', '', '', '2024-10-29 01:42:06', '2024-10-29 01:42:06', '', 0, 'http://demo.thimpress.com/eduma/?post_type=lpr_course&amp;p=3138', 0, 'lp_course', '', 2),
(8804, 1, '2018-11-12 02:53:57', '2018-11-12 02:53:57', '<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>LearnPress</strong></a> is a comprehensive <em>WordPress LMS Plugin</em> for WordPress, just like WordPress Moodle or Moodle for WordPress if you know what Moodle is. This is one of the best WordPress LMS Plugins can be used to easily create &amp; sell courses online. Each Course Curriculum can be made with Lessons &amp; Quizzes which can be managed with easy-to-use user interface, we really made it for you with no code skill required to totally manage your Education WordPress Website.\n\nLearnPress is free and always be free, but it has premium high quality WordPress Plugin which will probably help you make money from your <strong>WordPress Based LMS</strong>, try and see how it is. LearnPress WordPress Online Course Plugin is lightweight but super powerful with lots of add-ons to empower its core system.\n<h3>LearnPress Features</h3>\n<strong>LearnPress - WordPress LMS Plugin works with your Themes</strong>\nWe create LearnPress LMS Plugin to work with any WordPress Themes.\n\n<strong>LearnPress supports WordPress Multisite</strong>\nCreate WordPress based LMS as multiple sites.\n\n<strong>Create Course</strong>\nLearnPress LMS Plugin provide an excellent user interface to create a course with options you need. You can find it easy to make a full curriculum layout as well as edit and maintain it. You can also export course and import to other website which also using LearnPress. We will provide the feature allow you to import course from other WordPress LMS plugins soon.\n\n<strong>Manage Course</strong>\nWith the course you\'ve created, you can share it, manage it, watch statistic about number of student, its trend, etc.\n\n<strong>Sell Course</strong>\nLearnPress is free but it still allow you to sell courses you create with support many billing method such as PayPal, Stripe, WooCommerce, etc.\n\n<strong>Communicate with your Students</strong>\nWith BuddyPress support, LearnPress will help you to communicate with your student or instructor via WordPress forum. Learning is not only on your own. Study, make friends and have fun.\n\n<strong>LearnPress provide a bunch of Add-ons</strong>\nAdd-on is used to providing extra features for LearnPress and you can also write it. <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Explore more</a>.\n\n<strong>LearnPress is FREE and always will be</strong>\nEducation should be FREE and we want you to bring it to as many people as you can. Therefore, we create LearnPress as a tool for you to create course and share it. We\'ll continue developing it as long as we can and make it better and better.\n\n<strong>LearnPress is actively developed</strong>\nWe are developing and improving LearnPress day by day and bringing new features to you cos we want LearnPress to become the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Best WordPress LMS Plugin</strong></a>.', 'What is LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'what-is-learnpress', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:53:57', '2018-11-12 02:53:57', '', 0, 'http://what-is-learnpress', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(8805, 1, '2018-11-12 02:54:00', '2018-11-12 02:54:00', '<span class=\"style-scope yt-formatted-string\" dir=\"auto\">LearnPress 4 generation is official released and this instruction is everything you need to know first. We provide you with the detailed guidelines: How to Install LearnPress, Create a Course, Create a Lesson, Create a Quiz, Course Settings,... All things you need to know to use LearnPress most effectively are here.</span>\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;', 'How to use LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-learnpress', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:54:00', '2018-11-12 02:54:00', '', 0, 'http://how-to-use-learnpress', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(8806, 1, '2018-11-12 02:54:04', '2018-11-12 02:54:04', '<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\n<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How WooCommerce Add-on for LearnPress works.</p>\n\n<ul>\n 	<li>The transaction can be done by WooCommerce account if other payment gateways are not available.</li>\n 	<li>Immigrate the profile page between WooCommerce and LearnPress. You can see the “Order” tab on the LearnPress profile page.</li>\n 	<li>Add an option which only allows customers to buy your courses as one product of WooCommerce.</li>\n</ul>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/woocommerce-add-on-for-learnpress/\">WooCommerce Add-on for LearnPress</a>\n\n</div>', 'How to use WooCommerce Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'certificate-add-on', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:54:04', '2018-11-12 02:54:04', '', 0, 'http://certificate-add-on', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 2),
(8807, 1, '2018-11-12 02:54:08', '2018-11-12 02:54:08', '<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\n\nHow Gradebook Add-on for LearnPress works.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Track students\' progress and result in each course.</li>\n 	<li>Allow exporting the Gradebook to CSV.</li>\n</ul>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/gradebook-add-on-for-learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gradebook Add-on for LearnPress</a>\n\n</div>\n&nbsp;', 'How to use Gradebook Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'woocommerce-payments-add-on', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:54:08', '2018-11-12 02:54:08', '', 0, 'http://woocommerce-payments-add-on', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(8808, 1, '2018-11-12 02:54:12', '2018-11-12 02:54:12', 'Stripe is fully integrated, this global platform can support online and in-person payments.\n\nLearnPress Strip add-on gives you another choice for Payment Gateway for your online courses by the unlimited power from Stripe.\n\nLearnpress Stripe integration add-on creates a variety of payment methods for your site. Transaction will be done in the best convenient way for both parties. Pay via Visa, MasteCcard, UnionPay, American Express, Alipay,… etc.\n\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/stripe-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Stripe Add-on for LearnPress</a>\n<div class=\"notranslate\" style=\"all: initial;\"></div>', 'How to use Stripe Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'co-instructors-add-on', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:54:12', '2018-11-12 02:54:12', '', 0, 'http://co-instructors-add-on', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(8809, 1, '2018-11-12 02:54:17', '2018-11-12 02:54:17', '<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-6031\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix elementor-active\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-6031\">\n\nWith Paid Membership Pro integration, you can create membership plans for your students. Following that, membership plans let students buy Membership and paying monthly for groups of course instead paying for every course. Paid Membership Pro makes your pricing methods become more flexible than ever.\n\n</div>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/paid-memberships-pro-add-learnpress/\">Paid Memberships Pro Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use Paid Memberships Pro Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'content-drip-add-on', '', '', '2018-11-12 02:54:17', '2018-11-12 02:54:17', '', 0, 'http://content-drip-add-on', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
