(13101, 1, '2024-10-28 02:48:25', '2024-10-28 02:48:25', '<span class=\"style-scope yt-formatted-string\" dir=\"auto\">A series of Videos from ThimPress, give you a detailed tutorial to create an LMS Website with LearnPress - LMS &amp; Education WordPress Plugin.</span>\n\nThis course is a detailed and easy tutorial to get you all setup and going with the use of <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>LearnPress LMS Plugin</strong></a>. It is a free and simple plugin to help you create an <strong>Online Courses Website</strong> step by step. The tutorial guides you through the configuration of the plugin, creation of Courses, Lessons, Quizzes, and finally guides you on how to boost up your Website with <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/wordpress/plugins/learnpress/?utm_source=Eduma&amp;utm_medium=Course&amp;utm_campaign=LMSWebsite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Premium LearnPress Add-ons</strong></a> brought to you by ThimPress (creator of LearnPress). It also shows how you could configure additional items like the course layouts and featured images.', 'Create an LMS Website with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress', '', '', '2024-10-28 02:48:25', '2024-10-28 02:48:25', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/?post_type=lp_course&amp;p=16988', 0, 'lp_course', '', 1),
(13103, 1, '2022-09-26 02:45:20', '2022-09-26 02:45:20', '<a href=\"https://thimpress.com/learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LearnPress</a> is an LMS WordPress plugin that comes with all the features you’ll ever need to create, manage, and sell awesome online courses on WordPress.\n\nLearnPress is free and always will be, but it is still a premium high-quality WordPress Plugin that definitely helps you with making money from your WordPress based LMS. Just try and see how amazing it is.', 'LMS Website and LearnPress Introduction', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'lms-website-and-learnpress-introduction-part-1', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:45:20', '2022-09-26 02:45:20', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/lms-website-and-learnpress-introduction-part-1/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13104, 1, '2022-09-26 02:45:44', '2022-09-26 02:45:44', 'If you are looking for a perfect domain and hosting for an LMS website, then this video is for you. It guides you on how to find the perfect domain name using Hostinger.\nThis is a step-by-step guide and we hope you get a lot of value from this video.', 'Select Domain and Hosting - Create an LMS Website with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'select-domain-and-hosting-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-2', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:45:44', '2022-09-26 02:45:44', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/select-domain-and-hosting-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13105, 1, '2022-09-26 02:46:25', '2022-09-26 02:46:25', 'The LearnPress installation is not hard at all. There is no experience required, you totally can do this if you can point and click.', 'LearnPress Installation Tutorial', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'learnpress-installation-tutorial-part-3', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:46:25', '2022-09-26 02:46:25', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/learnpress-installation-tutorial-part-3/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13106, 1, '2022-09-26 02:46:38', '2022-09-26 02:46:38', 'After the installation process, you need to configure LearnPress as the way you want. There are some important things need configuring such as course category, tag and featured image. Don\'t skip this step, just follow the instruction video and you will get it all.', 'Configure LearnPress Plugin - Create an LMS Website with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'configure-learnpress-plugin-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-4', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:46:38', '2022-09-26 02:46:38', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/configure-learnpress-plugin-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13107, 1, '2022-09-26 02:46:50', '2022-09-26 02:46:50', 'Each course contains lessons and quizzes, you need to provide enough information for your students. This introduction video also shows you some additional options that a course has.', 'Create Course & Introduce Options - Create an LMS Website with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'create-course-introduce-options-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-5', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:46:50', '2022-09-26 02:46:50', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/create-course-introduce-options-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13108, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:06', '2022-09-26 02:47:06', 'Lesson, quiz and question are indispensable elements of one course. LearnPress provides variant types of questions for your course, help you make your course more interesting to your students. Don\'t forget to prepare carefully quiz and question also, if you find anything difficult, watch this video till the end.', 'Create Lesson, Quiz, and Question with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'create-lesson-quiz-and-question-with-learnpress-part-6', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:06', '2022-09-26 02:47:06', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/create-lesson-quiz-and-question-with-learnpress-part-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13109, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:20', '2022-09-26 02:47:20', 'When you complete to prepare everything for your LMS website, it\'s time for you to sell your courses online. LearnPress supports WooCommerce and many other payment methods such as Stripe and PayPal. Also, with WooCommerce plugin, you can sell your course online as a WooCommerce product.', 'Configure Payments and Email - Create an LMS Website with LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'configure-payments-and-email-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-7', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:20', '2022-09-26 02:47:20', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/configure-payments-and-email-create-an-lms-website-with-learnpress-part-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13110, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:26', '2022-09-26 02:47:26', 'How the student purchases, learns and finishes your courses?  This video will show every single detailed information that you need to understand how LearnPress works.', 'How the Student Enrolls and Finishes a Course', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-the-student-enrolls-and-finishes-a-course-part-8', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:26', '2022-09-26 02:47:26', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/how-the-student-enrolls-and-finishes-a-course-part-8/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13111, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:39', '2022-09-26 02:47:39', 'All information of each user will show on the user profile page. In this video, we describe each feature on the user profile page of the LearnPress plugin. The user can view the details of the order, and progress of the course, all on this page.', 'Page Profile Overview', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'page-profile-overview-part-9', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:39', '2022-09-26 02:47:39', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/page-profile-overview-part-9/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13112, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:47', '2022-09-26 02:47:47', 'It is easy to manage an order if you watch this video. We will show you how to manage the order with the LearnPress plugin. Besides the order tab, we have a guide to use the tool tab of LearnPress. This is a tool which helps you change the progress of the user, install simple data, check out of date templates and more. Let try it!', 'Introduce Order Tab and Tool Tab of LearnPress', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'introduce-order-tab-and-tool-tab-of-learnpress-part-10', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:47', '2022-09-26 02:47:47', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/introduce-order-tab-and-tool-tab-of-learnpress-part-10/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13113, 1, '2022-09-26 02:47:56', '2022-09-26 02:47:56', 'Highly recommended by LearnPress users, we are pleased to introduce you to our best <a href=\"https://1.envato.market/G5Ook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Education WordPress Themes</a>. With the Eduma theme (#1 Selling Education WordPress Theme) only with a click, you will have a perfect website for LMS. Fully compatible with the LearnPress and more stunning plugins.', 'Introduce Education WordPress Theme and Import Demo', '	', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'introduce-education-wordpress-theme-and-import-demo-part-11', '', '', '2022-09-26 02:47:56', '2022-09-26 02:47:56', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/lessons/introduce-education-wordpress-theme-and-import-demo-part-11/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
