(13591, 1, '2022-12-12 07:17:36', '2022-12-12 07:17:36', 'How Frontend Editor Add-on for LearnPress works.\n<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\n<ul>\n 	<li>Create a page where all instructors can access and edit courses on Frontend, without having to access WordPress Dashboard.</li>\n 	<li>You can Create Course, Edit Course, Create Lessons, Edit Lessons, Configure course setting with this Frontend Editor Add-on.</li>\n</ul>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/frontend-editor-add-on-for-learnpress/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Frontend Editor Add-on for LearnPress</a>\n\n</div>', 'How to use Frontend Editor Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-frontend-editor-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:17:36', '2022-12-12 07:17:36', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-frontend-editor-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13594, 1, '2022-12-12 07:23:39', '2022-12-12 07:23:39', 'When your students finish a course, you can provide a certifications for passed students – a proof for completing the course. You can self-design the certification or use an available template/sample to edit. Therefore, you can add and customize many informations, create the unique certification for your course.\n\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/certificates-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Certificates Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use Certificates Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-certificates-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:23:39', '2022-12-12 07:23:39', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-certificates-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13596, 1, '2022-12-12 07:26:16', '2022-12-12 07:26:16', '<div id=\"elementor-tab-content-8111\" class=\"elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix elementor-active\" role=\"tabpanel\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-8111\">When you have new contents, deals, offers, announcements, news, updates, you can use Announcement add-on to stick your announcement on the Announcement tab. Your students will see this announcement when they log in and reply if they want.</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-8111\"></div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-8111\">How Announcement Add-on for LearnPress works.</div>\n<div role=\"tabpanel\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"elementor-tab-title-8111\">\n<div class=\"woocommerce-product-details__short-description\">\n<ul>\n 	<li>Enable Announcement for LearnPress courses.</li>\n 	<li>Show announcement to your students about new  contents, deals, offers, announcements, news, or updates.</li>\n 	<li>Send email to your subscribers and other students about your new announcement. Spread the words!</li>\n</ul>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/announcement-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Announcement Add-on for LearnPress</a>\n\n</div>\n</div>', 'How to use Announcement Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-announcement-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:26:16', '2022-12-12 07:26:16', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-announcement-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13598, 1, '2022-12-12 07:28:55', '2022-12-12 07:28:55', 'This Co-instructor add-on allows you or any other instructors to add someone as Co-instructor of their courses. Co-instructors will be listed in the list of the course’s teacher. People who are added to be co-instructors can manage the course also.\n\nTo ensure the stability, each instructor only can edit the content they created. LearnPress also has the option to let you choose if instructor’s lessons and courses can be published immediately or will be reviewed before publishing.\n\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/co-instructors-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Co-Instructors Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use Co-Instructors Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-co-instructors-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:28:55', '2022-12-12 07:28:55', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-co-instructors-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13600, 1, '2022-12-12 07:31:30', '2022-12-12 07:31:30', 'Set schedule for publishing courses and restricting the access of students to each lesson by progress, or time. Content Drip helps you create and manage your courses easier.\n\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/content-drip-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Content Drip Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use Content Drip Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-content-drip-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:31:30', '2022-12-12 07:31:30', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-content-drip-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13602, 1, '2022-12-12 07:32:48', '2022-12-12 07:32:48', 'Assignment Add-on for LearnPress is a great way to assign tasks, or essays to your students so they can do as well as submit at home. Instructors can check students’ work after that and grade their assignments.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Based on the increasing demand in using Assignment and letting instructors grade the assignment, we have released the Assignment add-on for LearnPress.</li>\n 	<li>With Assignment add-on, your course will be more flexible so that the instructors can create homework, essay tasks and setup a deadline for the student to submit their work. After that, the instructor can check the student’s work and grade their performance. There will be email notifications to the students when their assignments have been graded.</li>\n 	<li>Using Assignment, you will have another way of grading and won’t be too  much dependent on Quizzes. You can let students and instructors communicate and discuss and generate better outcomes.</li>\n</ul>\nLearn More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/assignments-add-on-for-learnpress/\">Assignments Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use Assignments Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-assignments-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:32:48', '2022-12-12 07:32:48', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-assignments-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13604, 1, '2022-12-12 07:34:05', '2022-12-12 07:34:05', 'Having more than 150,000+ users who come from all over the world, translation is a must-have to LearnPress. With the help from WPML, WPLM add-on for LearnPress is the perfect solution for LearnPress users to translate anything flashily. Now, LearnPress users can focus on creating amazing contents without the worries about language restrictions.\n\nLear More: <a href=\"https://thimpress.com/product/wpml-add-on-for-learnpress/\">WPML Add-on for LearnPress</a>', 'How to use WPML Add-on for LearnPress?', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'how-to-use-wpml-add-on-for-learnpress', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:34:05', '2022-12-12 07:34:05', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/lessons/how-to-use-wpml-add-on-for-learnpress/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(13606, 1, '2022-12-12 07:35:56', '2022-12-12 07:35:56', 'A series question allows you can see all question types available in the LearnPress plugin.', 'Demo the Quiz of LearnPress', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'demo-the-quiz-of-the-learnpresscopy', '', '', '2022-12-12 07:35:56', '2022-12-12 07:35:56', '', 0, 'https://eduma.thimpress.com/demo-main/quizzes/demo-the-quiz-of-the-learnpresscopy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
